{"3659810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Chef", "steam_appid": 3659810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/f4275a9b56887a2c9570bf6e6938a523.poster.avif?t=1766081055\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/f4275a9b56887a2c9570bf6e6938a523.webm?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/f4275a9b56887a2c9570bf6e6938a523.mp4?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook for Your Life!</strong></h2><strong>Prepare meals using zombie limbs and store bought ingredients!  <br>Even the slightest mistake will turn the kitchen into a battlefield, and delays will enrage the zombies.  <br>Make dishes with minced limbs, meat, intestines, and brains!  <br>To survive, you must be both fast and careful!</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/0f9db94ac4804ef588ea7b89acee3d9e.poster.avif?t=1766081055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/0f9db94ac4804ef588ea7b89acee3d9e.webm?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/0f9db94ac4804ef588ea7b89acee3d9e.mp4?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show No Weakness!</strong></h2><strong>You won’t easily get rid of attacking zombies!  <br>Even with their bodies torn apart, they remain dangerous arms ripped off, they still attack; legs severed, they crawl after you.  <br>Once you stop them, carefully drag their bodies to cold storage.  <br>One careless moment, and you’ll become one of them.</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/5eb0a46a1ae3e3aa2ee8717ccda16603.poster.avif?t=1766081055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/5eb0a46a1ae3e3aa2ee8717ccda16603.webm?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/5eb0a46a1ae3e3aa2ee8717ccda16603.mp4?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crush and Store!</strong></h2><strong>Carry severed zombie limbs and bodies into the cold storage, hang them on hooks, and cut them into pieces.  <br>Store the parts neatly so they’ll be ready for bloody preparations in the kitchen.</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/dbf4c7bd316396dd6d37906ba764cb97.poster.avif?t=1766081055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/dbf4c7bd316396dd6d37906ba764cb97.webm?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/dbf4c7bd316396dd6d37906ba764cb97.mp4?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Market!</strong></h2><strong>At the market, you’ll find not only ingredients for recipes but also tools like cameras, traps, weapons, and hammers to upgrade doors.  <br>Grabbing the right supplies and equipment quickly makes cooking and defense easier; delays will lead to bloody consequences.</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/050c260d33c7dd4787197768227d6017.poster.avif?t=1766081055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/050c260d33c7dd4787197768227d6017.webm?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/050c260d33c7dd4787197768227d6017.mp4?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bloody Moon!</strong></h2><strong>When the Bloody Moon rises, zombie hunger becomes unstoppable!  <br>Doors, traps, and defenses won’t hold them back.  <br>A furious undead horde will come knocking at your door!  <br>Prepare your defenses quickly and do everything you can to survive!</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/a73e59c58ae7ca81e5ee6a516f543fa9.poster.avif?t=1766081055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/a73e59c58ae7ca81e5ee6a516f543fa9.webm?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/a73e59c58ae7ca81e5ee6a516f543fa9.mp4?t=1766081055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect Yourself!</strong></h2><strong>Defend your home against ever growing zombie attacks each night!  <br>Reinforce your doors, add locks, and control your defense line.  <br>Use bear t